SUMMARY:Gathering at Marina Beach\, Chennai
DESCRIPTION:A gathering against the revision on Constitution Day at Marina 
 Beach\, Chennai\, at 6:00 pm\, listed on the People Against SIR map with t
 he host We the People. Organised by We the People. Place: Marina Beach\, C
 hennai. Source: https://peopleagainstsir.org/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/events/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ev-97@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261106T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:Memoranda to the President in every district of Madhya Pradesh on C
 onstitution Day\, decided by organisations of People Against SIR
DESCRIPTION:A meeting of organisations linked to People Against SIR in Madh
 ya Pradesh decided to hand memoranda addressed to the President in every d
 istrict of the state on Constitution Day\, 26 November\, through the Distr
 ict Collectors\, and to give a memorandum to the state's Chief Electoral O
 fficer in Bhopal the same day seeking the revision's cancellation\, accord
 ing to an unsigned text datelined Bhopal that two news sites carried word 
 for word. The report says members would hand over the memoranda by joining
  protests organised by the Samyukta Kisan Morcha\, and that each programme
  would open with a reading of the Preamble and close with the burning of c
 opies of the revision's notification. It says the demands of the platform\
 , which it says 150 organisations across the country formed\, include canc
 elling the revision\, updating the 2024 roll and the resignation and arres
 t of the Chief Election Commissioner. It also reports decisions to hold a 
 people's parliament on 10 December at Jantar Mantar seeking its renotifica
 tion as a site for peaceful protest\, people's courts at every polling sta
 tion on 20 December and a people's parade on Republic Day\, 26 January 202
 7\, and to form a state committee soon. Organised by Organisations linked 
 to People Against SIR in Madhya Pradesh\, as the report describes them. Pl
 ace: Every district of Madhya Pradesh\, through the Collectors\, and the C
 hief Electoral Officer in Bhopal. Source: https://mediasaheb.com/people-ag
 ainst-sir-madhya-pradesh-meeting-150-organizations-demand-cancellation-of-
 sir/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/events/
END:VEVENT
