UID:ev-83@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261106T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261128
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261129
SUMMARY:IICC Dialogues\, 'SIR\, I am deleted. Get me back'\, in New Delhi
DESCRIPTION:A public discussion on the revision in the India Islamic Cultur
 al Centre's IICC Dialogues series\, with Nitin Sethi\, founding editor of 
 the Reporters' Collective\, the Supreme Court senior advocate Vrinda Grove
 r\, and Sravasti Dasgupta\, senior political correspondent at The Wire\, w
 ho also moderates. In his post announcing it\, Nitin Sethi said they would
  talk about what the Collective has learnt from more than a year of invest
 igation that has so far produced nearly 50 reports\, and invited anyone in
 terested to join. Organised by India Islamic Cultural Centre\, New Delhi (
 IICC Dialogues). Place: India Islamic Cultural Centre\, 87-88 Lodhi Road\,
  New Delhi. Source: https://x.com/nit_set/status/2124416367306875061
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/events/
END:VEVENT
