 untepalya police in Bengaluru registered on 7 October over Form 7 applicat
 ions filed to delete six electors\, which concerns allegations against the
  Jayanagar MLA of the BJP\, C K Ramamurthy\, and three others\, W.P. No. 3
 2768 of 2026. The petition is next listed on this date. On 20 November the
  Court declined to stay the investigation\, directed that the petitioners 
